<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Sept 16.</p>
<p>CROPS	   SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>		  1996 91/95 Avg 1996 91/95 Avg</p>
<p>winter wheat    2    9	  97   89</p>
<p>spring wheat   39   27	  43   49</p>
<p>durum wheat    24   20	  55   50</p>
<p>oats	     44   31	  33   42</p>
<p>barley	   37   27	  51   55</p>
<p>fall rye	  1    5	  99   95</p>
<p>spring rye	6   28	  94   63</p>
<p>flax	     19   19	   3   13</p>
<p>canola	   48   43	  48   49</p>
<p>mustard	  25   25	  63   54</p>
<p>sunflowers	0    3	   0    2</p>
<p>lentils	  15   17	  76   61</p>
<p>peas	     13   15	  70   55</p>
<p>canary seed    18   17	  10   25</p>
<p>total	    35   28	  46   49</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
